// Car log (picture 221 A, Loudjier Nov 13, 2026: "the user can even add when they went to the car wash, gas, service,
// add receipt"). Gas, car wash, service, repair, parking, tolls or other, with cost, date, miles, where, gallons (gas)
// and a receipt photo that stays on the phone (option 1). Service rows are the old Service history, so oil changes still
// teach "what's due". Totals and real MPG come only from what they typed. Free account.
